      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そう言えば……。\r\nアタシの知り合いのおじいさんが\r\n三代目シドがいた時代の歌をよくうたっていた気がする。",
        "official_en": "Hmm... There’s this old guy I know, and he used to always sing a song from that exact era.",
        "real_en": "Oh, that reminds me... I think an old man I know used to sing a song from the time of the third Cid."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
